@startuml F0.7-c-certificado-404
title F0.7-c — 404 hash não encontrado
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Verificador" as Verificador
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "CertificadoController" as Ctrl
participant "VerificarCertificadoUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Verificador -> WebApp: hash inexistente
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET certificado
Ctrl -> UC: execute(hash)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT certificado
Postgres --> UC: vazio
UC --> Ctrl: not found
Ctrl --> WebApp: 404

note right of WebApp
  Sem GET JWKS
  Sem dados do beneficiário
  RN-F0.7-09
end note

WebApp --> Verificador: selo "Certificado inválido"

@enduml
